{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-5","kind":"proposition","title":"三边成比例的三角形相似","englishTitle":"If two triangles have their sides proportional, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal which the corresponding sides subtend.","book":6,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","contentId":"euclid-6-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bab963c76616039708455bf636c68d362bdc909d074225571cb7d2c051d094e3","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-5.statement","euclid-6-5.construction.1","euclid-6-5.proof.1","euclid-6-5.proof.2","euclid-6-5.proof.3","euclid-6-5.proof.4","euclid-6-5.proof.5","euclid-6-5.proof.6","euclid-6-5.proof.7","euclid-6-5.proof.8","euclid-6-5.proof.9","euclid-6-5.proof.10","euclid-6-5.conclusion","euclid-6-5.historical.1","euclid-6-5.historical.2","euclid-6-5.historical.3","euclid-6-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1cd5d1497b6cdc433317b5630450debe5540aa6ee171cb109ca5fbaf8e18fa74","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have their sides proportional, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal which the corresponding sides subtend."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角有其侧面成比例, 三角形将是等角, 并且这些角与对应的侧面的角相等 。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其各两边之比例等即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的每边比例相等，这意味着这两个形状是关于相似边角度相等的等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07cb0e86057d60bdd2cfe0637d2f4a0acb04a119a238899321b73c10472e86db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having their sides proportional, so that, as AB is to BC, so is DE to EF, as BC is to CA, so is EF to FD, and further, as BA is to AC, so is ED to DF; I say that the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF, and they will have those angles equal which the corresponding sides subtend, namely the angle ABC to the angle DEF, the angle BCA to the angle EFD, and further the angle BAC to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF三角为两边成比例,AB和BC的比等于DE和EF的比,BC和CA的比等于EF和FD的比,BA和AC的比等于ED和DF的比;我说三角ABC是三角DEF的等角,它们具有相应的角所向下所向,即角ABC至角DEF,角BCA至角EFD,角BAC至角EDF；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DE 与 EF 之比；BC 与 CA 之比等于 EF 与 FD 之比；BA 与 AC 之比等于 ED 与 DF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c95ad7fb81af330b74a78223b85fe0ba656b631d8c966622000de44dd4a108be","citations":["euclid-1-23","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on the straight line EF, and at the points E, F on it, let there be constructed the angle FEG equal to the angle ABC, and the angle EFG equal to the angle ACB; [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] therefore the remaining angle at A is equal to the remaining angle at G. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线EF和E、F点,应建造FEG角等于ABC角,EFG角等于ACB角;因此,A点的剩余角等于G点的剩余角。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9a544ed216e525cbe155744cfa1d8a3c2f1e8c0af5953b5f919ed03d87e2807","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle GEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC是同三角形GEF的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b80c1f0c1e5fb866bb7c29d914137fc0b73fee566e5a381c2ddbd2057720d80","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the triangles ABC, GEF the sides about the equal angles are proportional, and those are corresponding sides which subtend the equal angles; [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore, as AB is to BC, so is GE to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在三角形ABC、GEF中,角相等的两边是成比例,而角相等的两边是相应的两边,因此,AB对BC的比等于GE对EF的比；AB 与 BC 之比等于 GE 与 EF 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab27deb192a55c763f530653ce021a6ed236fbd971d4d75eecf3b65894d8095e","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to BC, so by hypothesis is DE to EF; therefore, as DE is to EF, so is GE to EF. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于AB比BC,因此假设是DE比EF;因此,DE比EF等于GE比EF；DE 与 EF 之比等于 GE 与 EF 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ea80636e02b2d7e160de6314cd8338d7585758a3ac98567d07b175ef4efb0a7","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the straight lines DE, GE has the same ratio to EF; therefore DE is equal to GE. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DE、GE直线的每条比例与EF相同;因此,DE直线等于GE直线。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f327bc57af6738c6a820caafeaef06a5a889b3145c1928c7882ad39558f9ea17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason DF is also equal to GF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,DF也等于GF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"904f1dd185b00ea396df3912fa5b334d6ddae89ef4d4130f622ab05f129c5706","citations":["euclid-1-8","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then DE is equal to EG, and EF is common, the two sides DE, EF are equal to the two sides GE, EF; and the base DF is equal to the base FG; therefore the angle DEF is equal to the angle GEF, [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)] and the triangle DEF is equal to the triangle GEF, and the remaining angles are equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE等于EG,EF是常见的,双方DE,EF等于双方GE,EF;底边,DF等于底边,FG;因此,角度DEF等于角度GEF,三角形DEF等于三角形GEF,其余角度等于其余角度,即平等方所支持的角度。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36eb779de8abc4e6208d906d046189a5697e8d642e6b0d1252204cfff4498305","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle DFE is also equal to the angle GFE, and the angle EDF to the angle EGF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DFE角也等于GFE角,EDF角等于EGF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"53b933b6bebc847f0190d7e47d0f04b8f484ebca39c3faa3bd40c3e8a2889c88","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle FED is equal to the angle GEF, while the angle GEF is equal to the angle ABC, therefore the angle ABC is also equal to the angle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于FED角度等于GEF角度,而GEF角度等于ABC角度,因此ABC角度也等于DEF角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83bd01d88eae6d6750d71059f1afcc3fdfa4adf4a2e03ff64cf3277ea7c926c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle ACB is also equal to the angle DFE, and further, the angle at A to the angle at D; therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,ACB角也等于DFE角,此外,A角等于D角;因此,三角形ABC是三角形DEF的等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ebccd87d98bdc519cb8974676dbb19d7daa358aab0be99d7dfd5ec991aa0c83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其各两边之比例等即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的每边比例相等，这意味着这两个形状是关于相似边角度相等的等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb722e962cc7c926c2e8457d81ab4a8bb4dab9866834b97da391e6e74a44a2c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁戊己两角形其各两边之比例等者甲乙与乙丙若丁戊与戊己而乙丙与甲丙若戊己与丁己甲丙与甲乙若丁己与丁戊也题言此两形为等角形而对各相似边之角甲与丁乙与戊丙与己各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己，两个三角形每边比例相等。如果 甲乙 和 乙丙 分别为 丁戊 和 戊己，乙丙 和 甲丙，那么 戊己 和 丁己甲丙 及 甲乙，如果 丁己 和 丁戊 是等边三角形，该命题表明这两个三角形相等，并且角 甲、丁乙、戊丙 和 己 都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07450c7ecda715c7cd3bd1b539f906165b604e2c129a5f6113ed80bc71003cee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作己戊庚角与乙角等作庚己戊角与丙角等而戊庚己庚两线遇于庚即庚角与甲角等〈一卷三二〉是甲乙丙庚戊己两形等角矣则甲乙与乙丙之比例若庚戊与戊己也〈本篇四〉甲乙与乙丙元若丁戊与戊己则庚戊与戊己亦若丁戊与戊己也〈五卷十一〉而丁戊与庚戊两线必等〈五卷九〉又乙丙与甲丙之比例若戊己与庚己〈本篇四〉而乙丙与甲丙元若戊己与丁己则戊己与庚己亦若戊己与丁己也〈五卷十一〉而丁己与庚己两线必等〈五卷九〉夫庚戊庚己两腰既与丁戊丁己两腰各等戊己同底即丁角与庚角亦等〈一卷八〉其馀庚戊己与丁戊己庚己戊与丁己戊各相当之角俱等〈一卷四〉而庚角与甲角既等即丁角与甲角亦等丁戊己角与乙角丁己戊角与丙角俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：实验中，使 己戊庚 和 乙 角相等，并且 庚己戊 和 丙 角相等。两条直线 戊庚己庚 在 庚 相交，也就是说，庚 和 甲 角相等。〈一卷三二〉 是 甲乙丙庚戊己 的两个相等角。因此，甲乙 与 乙丙 的比值为 〈本篇四〉，甲乙 与 乙丙 的比值也相等。如果 丁戊 和 戊己 是 戊己，那么 庚戊 和 戊己 也相等，因为 丁戊 和 戊己 为 〈五卷十一〉。丁戊 和 庚戊 必须相等。〈五卷九〉 和 乙丙 及 甲丙 为 戊己 与 甲丙 的比值，庚己 为 〈本篇四〉，乙丙 与 甲丙 的比值。如果 戊己 和 甲丙 以及 乙丙，则 丁戊 和 乙丙 也相等。如果 丁戊 和 戊己 相等，那么 庚戊 和 戊己 必须相等。〈五卷九〉 和 乙丙 比例相等。如果 戊己 和 甲丙 以及 乙丙 是 〈五卷十一〉，丁戊 和 甲丙 必须相等。如果 戊己 和 甲丙 以及 乙丙 是 〈五卷十一〉，丁戊 和 甲丙 必须相等。如果 戊己 和 庚戊 相等，戊己 和 甲丙 以及 乙丙 相等。〈五卷十一〉 和 甲丙 必须相等。如果 戊己 和 甲丙 以及 甲丙 和 甲丙，那么 戊己 和 甲丙 必须相等。〈五卷九〉 和 乙丙 必须相等。如果 戊己 和 甲丙 以及 甲丙 和 甲丙，那么相较于 甲丙，如果 戊己 和 丁己 相等，那么 戊己 和 庚己 也相等，并且 戊己 和 丁己 也是 〈五卷十一〉，同时两条直线 丁己 和 庚己 必须相等，〈五卷九〉 和 庚戊庚己 的两条边与 丁戊丁己 的两条边相等，戊己 与 戊己 和 庚 相同，因此 丁 和 庚 也相等，〈一卷八〉 和 庚戊己、丁戊己庚己戊 及 丁己戊 的角都相等 〈一卷四〉，庚 和 甲 相等，也就是说，丁 和 甲 相等，乙、丁己戊 和 丙 都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-5.source","contentId":"euclid-6-5","revisionId":"euclid-6-5@raw-bab963c766160397","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c02f0719df468f381f2cdd26a8fc9c504ed5140e1b1d77eeef6c00ce88b9faf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-5:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-5:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-5:eucl